{"seq":1,"slug":"columnar-encoding-taxonomy","title":"列编码体系与类型映射：Delta/DoubleDelta/Gorilla/T64/LowCardinality","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/clickhouse-mergetree-columnar-engine-internals/columnar-compression-encoding/columnar-encoding-taxonomy","wordCount":2414,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"列编码体系与类型映射-delta-doubledelta-gorilla-t64-lowcardinality\">列编码体系与类型映射：Delta/DoubleDelta/Gorilla/T64/LowCardinality</h1><p>跨境电商订单表里有一个 <code>order_status</code> 列，取值只有五种，用 <code>String</code> 存一天 5000 万行要吃掉约 1 GB；换成 <code>LowCardinality(String)</code> 之后只占约 60 MB。同一张表的 <code>event_time</code> 列每秒一条，直接落盘压缩比只有 3 倍；加上 <code>CODEC(DoubleDelta, ZSTD(1))</code> 之后冲到 40 倍以上。两个例子说明同一件事：在 ClickHouse 里，<strong>编码不是压缩的可选项，而是数据类型声明的一部分</strong>。这一篇把编码分成&quot;专用变换&quot;与&quot;通用压缩&quot;两层，逐类拆开 Delta/DoubleDelta/Gorilla/T64/LowCardinality 的算法、参数与适用类型，最后给出由测量驱动的选型流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-编码是两层管线-不是单个压缩算法\">核心概念：编码是两层管线，不是单个压缩算法</h2><p>ClickHouse 官方把 codec 分成三组：通用压缩（<code>NONE</code>/<code>LZ4</code>/<code>LZ4HC</code>/<code>ZSTD</code>）、专用变换（<code>Delta</code>/<code>DoubleDelta</code>/<code>GCD</code>/<code>Gorilla</code>/<code>ALP</code>/<code>FPC</code>/<code>T64</code> 等）和加密（<code>AES_128_GCM_SIV</code>）。真正决定压缩率的是第二组，但它单独用不了——官方明确写着 Delta &quot;cannot be used stand-alone&quot;，必须接一个通用压缩器。所以 <code>CODEC(Delta, ZSTD)</code> 是一条从左到右的流水线：原始值经 Delta 变换成小整数序列，再经 ZSTD 压缩成存储字节。第一层把数据里<strong>隐藏的规律显式化</strong>——单调递增变成接近零的小整数、相邻浮点变成共享高位、重复字符串变成短整数索引；第二层对已规整的字节流做通用压缩。变换决定压缩率的<strong>上限</strong>，通用压缩器只负责逼近它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    RAW[&quot;列原始值序列&quot;] --&gt; SPLIT{&quot;该列的取值规律是什么&quot;}&#10;    SPLIT --&gt;|&quot;单调 / 近等差&quot;| D[&quot;Delta / DoubleDelta&quot;]&#10;    SPLIT --&gt;|&quot;相邻浮点接近&quot;| G[&quot;Gorilla / FPC / ALP&quot;]&#10;    SPLIT --&gt;|&quot;整数高位冗余&quot;| T[&quot;T64 / GCD&quot;]&#10;    SPLIT --&gt;|&quot;重复值多&quot;| LC[&quot;LowCardinality&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; GEN[&quot;通用压缩器&lt;br/&gt;LZ4 / ZSTD&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; GEN&#10;    T --&gt; GEN&#10;    LC --&gt; GEN&#10;    GEN --&gt; DISK[&quot;写入 part 的列文件&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    RAW[\"列原始值序列\"] --&gt; SPLIT{\"该列的取值规律是什么\"}\n    SPLIT --&gt;|\"单调 / 近等差\"| D[\"Delta / DoubleDelta\"]\n    SPLIT --&gt;|\"相邻浮点接近\"| G[\"Gorilla / FPC / ALP\"]\n    SPLIT --&gt;|\"整数高位冗余\"| T[\"T64 / GCD\"]\n    SPLIT --&gt;|\"重复值多\"| LC[\"LowCardinality\"]\n    D --&gt; GEN[\"通用压缩器&lt;br/&gt;LZ4 / ZSTD\"]\n    G --&gt; GEN\n    T --&gt; GEN\n    LC --&gt; GEN\n    GEN --&gt; DISK[\"写入 part 的列文件\"]</pre><p>图中 <code>LowCardinality</code> 单独走一条分支：它不是 codec，而是<strong>类型修饰符</strong>，改的是列的物理表示（整数索引 + 字典），字典本身再交给通用压缩器。它必须写进类型里；而 <code>CODEC(...)</code> 只影响存储字节、对查询语义零影响，可事后 <code>ALTER TABLE ... MODIFY COLUMN</code> 调整（见 <a href=\"../mergetree-part-storage-model/part-inspection-mutation-repair\">部件诊断与 Mutation 变更</a>）。</p>\n<p>自管理版本默认 <code>LZ4</code>、ClickHouse Cloud 默认 <code>ZSTD</code>（<code>clickhouse.com/docs/en/sql-reference/statements/create/table</code>）：没写 <code>CODEC</code> 的列已有一层通用压缩。<code>ZSTD</code> 的 level 范围 1–22（默认 1），<code>LZ4HC</code> 范围 1–12（默认 9，官方推荐 4–9）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"delta-与-doubledelta-把有序性变成小整数\">Delta 与 DoubleDelta：把有序性变成小整数</h2><p><code>Delta</code> 做相邻差分：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i&#x27; = v_i - v_{i-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0106em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_0&#x27; = v_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。一列单调递增的订单 ID <code>1000001, 1000002, ...</code> 变换后全变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1, 1, 1, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>，通用压缩器能把几万个值压到几乎为零。参数 <code>Delta(delta_bytes)</code> 默认取 <code>sizeof(type)</code>，官方已把显式传参标记为 deprecated。</p>\n<p><code>DoubleDelta</code> 再做一次差分，即二阶差分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dd_i = (v_i - v_{i-1}) - (v_{i-1} - v_{i-2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，针对&quot;一阶差分很大但恒定&quot;的序列：一列每 5 分钟上报一条的 <code>DateTime</code>，原始值每次跨 300 秒，二阶差分恒为 0。官方博客有实测：NOAA 气象数据集的 <code>date</code> 列（<code>Date32</code>）默认压缩下占 2.24 GiB、压缩比只有 1.76；改用 <code>CODEC(DoubleDelta, ZSTD(1))</code> 后降到 24.11 MiB，整表压缩比达到 169.17（<code>clickhouse.com/blog/optimize-clickhouse-codecs-compression-schema</code>）。选型判据：<strong>严格等差</strong>用 <code>DoubleDelta</code>，<strong>单调但步长抖动</strong>（有空洞的订单 ID）用 <code>Delta</code>，<strong>随机值</strong>则不用专用变换。</p>\n<p><code>GCD()</code> 是互补手段：当一列的值都是某个公因子的倍数（例如所有价格以分为单位、最小单位是 5 分），<code>GCD</code> 把每个值除以最大公因子、整体缩小值域，再接通用压缩器；适用于整数、<code>Decimal</code> 与日期时间列，同样不能单独使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gorilla-与-fpc-alp-浮点序列的-xor-与预测编码\">Gorilla 与 FPC/ALP：浮点序列的 XOR 与预测编码</h2><p>浮点不能做差分——两个相邻 <code>Float64</code> 相减通常仍是满精度的随机尾数，差分不但不值钱还损失可压缩性。针对浮点有三种变换。</p>\n<p><strong><code>Gorilla</code></strong> 借自 Facebook 的 Gorilla 时序数据库，对相邻值做按位异或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>bits</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mtext>bits</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i = \\text{bits}(v_i) \\oplus \\text{bits}(v_{i-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bits</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bits</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。相邻值相等或接近时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 绝大多数位是 0，只需几比特就能编码一个值。参数 <code>Gorilla(bytes_size)</code> 取 1/2/4/8，默认取类型的自然宽度。它的假设是<strong>相邻值变化很小</strong>——CPU 利用率、温度、汇率这类缓慢漂移的指标很合适；高频抖动的随机浮点会让异或结果高位全亮，反而更差。</p>\n<p><strong><code>FPC(level, float_size)</code></strong> 用&quot;预测 + XOR&quot;两步：先用上几个值构造线性预测器猜出下一个值，再对预测值与真实值异或。<code>level</code> 取 1–28（默认 12），<code>float_size</code> 取 4 或 8；对 64 位浮点 FPC 通常比 Gorilla 更快。<strong><code>ALP(variant)</code></strong> 是较新的无损浮点编码（实验性，需 <code>SET enable_alp_codec = 1</code>）：<code>variant</code> 取 <code>AUTO</code>（默认）、<code>STD</code>（适合十进制来源的数）或 <code>RD</code>（适合高位共享的数），它把浮点还原成&quot;整数 + 十进制指数&quot;后再压缩。</p>\n<p>反直觉的实测结论：在上面那份 NOAA 数据集里，<code>lat</code>/<code>lon</code> 两个 <code>Float32</code> 列用 <code>Gorilla</code> 和 <code>FPC</code> 反而<strong>增大</strong>了存储，纯 <code>ZSTD(1)</code> 把它们压到 3.64 MiB / 3.63 MiB、压缩比 1128.65 / 1130.98。因为这两列的小数部分几乎没有规律，XOR 后没有可利用的稀疏性。<strong>专用变换是假设，不是优化。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"t64-与-gcd-整数高位冗余的位转置\">T64 与 GCD：整数高位冗余的位转置</h2><p><code>T64</code> 处理另一类冗余：整数类型宽度固定，实际取值却远小于类型能表示的范围。一列&quot;商品评分 1–5&quot;存成 <code>UInt32</code>，每个值最多用 3 位，剩下 29 位全是 0。<code>T64</code> 把<strong>连续 64 个整数排成位矩阵再转置</strong>：转置后同一&quot;位位置&quot;的值聚成一条连续位流，高位那条几乎全是 0，通用压缩器一眼压掉——用位转置把&quot;值内部的高位冗余&quot;变成&quot;列层面的连续冗余&quot;。它不带参数，适用于整数类型（含 <code>Enum</code>、<code>Date</code>、<code>DateTime</code>）。它与 <code>Delta</code> 的分工是——值<strong>有序</strong>时用 <code>Delta</code>/<code>DoubleDelta</code>，值<strong>无序但小</strong>时用 <code>T64</code>。上面那篇博客里 <code>tempAvg</code>/<code>tempMax</code> 两个 <code>Int16</code> 列最终选 <code>CODEC(T64, ZSTD(1))</code>。反面是警告：<strong>值随机分布时不要用</strong>，随机值每一位都接近熵满。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lowcardinality-字典编码是类型-不是压缩选项\">LowCardinality：字典编码是类型，不是压缩选项</h2><p><code>LowCardinality(T)</code> 与上面几种 codec 有本质区别：它改变列的<strong>物理表示</strong>。底层 <code>T</code> 允许 <code>String</code>、<code>FixedString</code>、<code>Date</code>、<code>DateTime</code> 以及除 <code>Decimal</code> 外的数值类型。写入时 ClickHouse 为每个 part 维护一份该列的字典（去重后的唯一值列表），列里实际存的是指向字典的整数键；键宽随规模从 <code>UInt8</code> 增长到 <code>UInt16</code>/<code>UInt32</code>。查询时比较与 <code>GROUP BY</code> 都在整数键上进行，字典解码只在需要原始字符串时发生。</p>\n<p>这带来三件事。<strong>存储</strong>：一天 5000 万行的 <code>order_status</code>（5 个唯一值）用 <code>String</code> 约 1 GB，<code>LowCardinality(String)</code> 只剩字典 + 每行 1 字节的键，降到 60 MB 量级。<strong>计算</strong>：比较渠道名退化成比较 <code>UInt8</code>/<code>UInt16</code>，聚合更快。<strong>代价</strong>：字典占内存、每个 part 各带一份，跨节点字典处理也有额外开销。官方文档给出的分档判据是选型关键（<code>clickhouse.com/docs/en/sql-reference/data-types/lowcardinality</code>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>唯一值数量</th>\n<th>官方结论</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 1 万</td>\n<td>&quot;mostly shows higher efficiency of data reading and storing&quot;</td>\n<td>值得用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 万 – 10 万</td>\n<td>收益与成本接近</td>\n<td>实测决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 10 万</td>\n<td>&quot;can perform worse in comparison with using ordinary data types&quot;</td>\n<td>不要用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>所以它不是&quot;字符串列一律加上&quot;的万能药。渠道、国家、状态、设备类型、支付方式这类<strong>封闭枚举</strong>是主场；用户 ID、订单号、URL、session id 这类高基数字符串加上去只会更慢。官方还明确推荐用它替代 <code>Enum</code>——<code>Enum</code> 要求预先声明全部取值、新增渠道要走 <code>ALTER</code>，而 <code>LowCardinality</code> 可随时插入新值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编码选型流程-从测量到决策\">编码选型流程：从测量到决策</h2><p>选型不能靠猜，必须从测量开始。每列的压缩结果暴露在 <code>system.columns</code> 里：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    name,&#10;    round(sum(data_uncompressed_bytes) / sum(data_compressed_bytes), 2) AS ratio,&#10;    any(compression_codec) AS codec&#10;FROM system.columns&#10;WHERE table = &#39;order_events&#39;&#10;GROUP BY name&#10;ORDER BY sum(data_compressed_bytes) DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_uncompressed_bytes) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_compressed_bytes), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    any(compression_codec) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> codec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> system</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">columns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'order_events'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_compressed_bytes) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>读结果表的规则不是&quot;压缩比低的都改&quot;，而是<strong>同时看绝对体积与压缩比</strong>：优先处理既占磁盘大头、压缩比又低的列。一个占 3 GB、压缩比 100 的列改不动什么；一个占 2 GB、压缩比 1.7 的列才是金矿。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>列的数据类型与分布</th>\n<th>完整 CODEC 写法</th>\n<th>关键判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>DateTime</code>/<code>Date</code> 等间隔</td>\n<td><code>CODEC(DoubleDelta, ZSTD(1))</code></td>\n<td>一阶差分恒定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单调自增整数 / ID</td>\n<td><code>CODEC(Delta, ZSTD(1))</code></td>\n<td>一阶差分小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DateTime</code> 秒级高抖动</td>\n<td><code>CODEC(Delta, LZ4)</code></td>\n<td>差分小但非恒定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓变浮点（指标、温度）</td>\n<td><code>CODEC(Gorilla, ZSTD)</code></td>\n<td>相邻值差极小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>十进制来源的浮点（金额）</td>\n<td><code>CODEC(ALP(STD), ZSTD)</code></td>\n<td>需 <code>enable_alp_codec</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小范围整数（状态码、评分）</td>\n<td><code>CODEC(T64, ZSTD(1))</code></td>\n<td>值远小于类型范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公因子倍数的整数 / <code>Decimal</code></td>\n<td><code>CODEC(GCD, ZSTD)</code></td>\n<td>值域可整体缩小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低基数 <code>String</code>/<code>Date</code></td>\n<td>类型改 <code>LowCardinality(String)</code></td>\n<td>唯一值 &lt; 1 万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机的 ID / 哈希 / 高精度浮点</td>\n<td><code>CODEC(ZSTD(3))</code></td>\n<td>无可用规律</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个工程注意点。<strong>层级顺序不能反</strong>：<code>CODEC(ZSTD, Delta)</code> 无意义，通用压缩先跑会破坏变换想利用的规律。<strong>加密 codec 必须置尾</strong>，官方写明 &quot;encryption only makes sense at the end of codec pipelines&quot;，需要压缩就显式写 <code>CODEC(Delta, LZ4, AES_128_GCM_SIV)</code>。<strong>考虑自适应选型</strong>：MergeTree 的 <code>enable_adaptive_codec_selection</code> 让默认压缩的列在后台合并时逐块在默认 codec / <code>NONE</code> / 合适的专用 codec 之间择优，每个块记录自己用的 codec，关掉该功能后数据仍可读。变更 codec 的代价要算清：<code>MODIFY COLUMN</code> 会重写该列所有 part，写入高峰是实打实的 I/O，成规模改动建议按分区逐个改或用 <code>INSERT SELECT</code> 迁数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>编码是类型声明的一部分</strong>：<code>LowCardinality(T)</code> 改物理表示（字典 + 整数键），<code>CODEC(...)</code> 只改存储字节。</li>\n<li><strong>两层管线</strong>：专用变换把数据规律显式化（决定压缩率上限），通用压缩器负责逼近；Delta 类变换不能单独使用。</li>\n<li><strong>Delta / DoubleDelta 利用有序性</strong>：等差序列用 <code>DoubleDelta</code>，步长抖动用 <code>Delta</code>；随机值不要用。</li>\n<li><strong>Gorilla / FPC / ALP 针对浮点</strong>：假设相邻值接近或数值近似定点，假设不成立时（随机 <code>Float32</code>）会<strong>劣于</strong>纯 <code>ZSTD</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>T64 处理整数高位冗余</strong>：位转置把值内冗余转成列级连续零，适合窄值域整数。</li>\n<li><strong>LowCardinality 有明确阈值</strong>：唯一值 &lt; 1 万值得用，&gt; 10 万要避免；官方推荐用它替代 <code>Enum</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>选型靠测量</strong>：从 <code>system.columns</code> 找出&quot;体积大且压缩比低&quot;的列，按类型映射表挑变换，再实测验证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"列编码体系与类型映射：Delta/DoubleDelta/Gorilla/T64/LowCardinality","id":"列编码体系与类型映射-delta-doubledelta-gorilla-t64-lowcardinality"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：编码是两层管线，不是单个压缩算法","id":"核心概念-编码是两层管线-不是单个压缩算法"},{"level":2,"text":"Delta 与 DoubleDelta：把有序性变成小整数","id":"delta-与-doubledelta-把有序性变成小整数"},{"level":2,"text":"Gorilla 与 FPC/ALP：浮点序列的 XOR 与预测编码","id":"gorilla-与-fpc-alp-浮点序列的-xor-与预测编码"},{"level":2,"text":"T64 与 GCD：整数高位冗余的位转置","id":"t64-与-gcd-整数高位冗余的位转置"},{"level":2,"text":"LowCardinality：字典编码是类型，不是压缩选项","id":"lowcardinality-字典编码是类型-不是压缩选项"},{"level":2,"text":"编码选型流程：从测量到决策","id":"编码选型流程-从测量到决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"部件诊断、Mutation 变更与损坏修复：system.parts 排查与恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/clickhouse-mergetree-columnar-engine-internals/mergetree-part-storage-model/part-inspection-mutation-repair"},"next":{"title":"编解码器链设计：LZ4/ZSTD/NONE 组合、顺序与 IO 权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/clickhouse-mergetree-columnar-engine-internals/columnar-compression-encoding/compression-codec-chain-design"}}